# apps/web React

- Place UI by role: `core` (leaf), `patterns` (composed controls), `containers` (feature blocks), `layouts` (page shells).
- Folder-per-component: `index.tsx`, `index.module.css`, `index.types.ts` when props/types exist.
- Prefer CSS Modules; match existing visual tokens and spacing.
- Import components via direct paths (e.g. `../../core/Button/index.js`), not layer barrels.
- Apply skills when relevant:
  - `.agents/skills/typescript-project-structure`
  - `.agents/skills/solid-typescript-design`
  - `.agents/skills/jsdoc-typescript-docs`
  - `.agents/skills/react-doctor`
  - `.agents/skills/vitest-web-testing`
